  "Specification": "Specification of the Paxos consensus algorithm without explicit leaders or learners. Acceptors process Phase1a/Phase1b (prepare) and Phase2a/Phase2b (accept) messages over a global msgs set. Maintains maxBal, maxVBal, maxVal per acceptor. Refines the Voting module via INSTANCE Voting; the theorem Spec => V!Spec asserts this refinement. Includes a candidate inductive invariant Inv used to prove the refinement.",
